<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Zimbabwe 145 all out v Sri Lanka (349).</title>
<headline>Cricket-Zimbabwe 145 all out v Sri Lanka (349).</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, replying to Sri Lanka's first innings 349, were all out for 145 on the third day of the first test on Friday.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe, 204 runs behind on the first innings, were forced to follow-on.</p>
